[{"client_msg_id":"3a58ff8c-86d1-4eb2-a77a-e3274300730b","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://forest.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1310937.html\u003e","ts":"1615299072.275900","attachments":[{"fallback":"窓の杜: “github.com”にセキュリティ問題、ユーザーアカウントの強制ログアウトを実施／ごく一部のアカウントで認証Cookieを取り違え。アカウントのパスワードなどには影響せず","id":1,"title":"“github.com”にセキュリティ問題、ユーザーアカウントの強制ログアウトを実施／ごく一部のアカウントで認証Cookieを取り違え。アカウントのパスワードなどには影響せず","title_link":"https://forest.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1310937.html","text":"　米GitHubは3月8日（現地時間、以下同）、“\u003chttp://github.com|github.com\u003e”でセキュリティ問題が発見されたと発表した。影響を受けるセッションはごく少数で、非常にまれなケースではあるものの、深刻な問題につながりかねないとして、念のため3月8日12時3分（協定世界時）以前に作成された認証済みセッションをすべて無効化する（ユーザーをログアウトさせる）処置をとったという。","image_url":"https://forest.watch.impress.co.jp/img/wf/list/1310/937/image1.png","blocks":null,"ts":1615276842,"service_name":"窓の杜","service_icon":"https://forest.watch.impress.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://forest.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1310937.html","original_url":"https://forest.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1310937.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"57wH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b834ec09-5426-462b-bc0d-05995145e976","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"引き続き鍵を見直してる\n• launchpad ecdsaまで\n• \u003chttp://sf.net|sf.net\u003e ぜんぶいける\n• osdn rsa/dsaだけっぽい...?\nosdnェ..","ts":"1615287161.275300","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1615290692.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":2,"users":["U81LLJ340","U01HXNSLCH5"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yvMB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03cd94ea-1244-4aff-922d-ae5353fa9ddf","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なるほど","ts":"1615283215.274000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zr="}]},{"client_msg_i